READING: the AP has the most harmonic relations => most short-shell cancellation.
The n=7 tiler cancels to safe=0 with FEWER harmonic relations (opus-S113 structure x width):
its wider window means the LONGER shells finish the cancellation.  The truncated theta
tracks 'how close to tiling'; the Selberg majorant makes the tail rigorous (N~2k^2).
